BT 1 0 0 1 0 37 Tm .055981 Tw /F3+0 11.6 Tf 16.2 TL (The Multi-Agent AI System for Disaster Response Coordination is an intelligent multi-agent reinforcement learning simulation system developed to coordinate emergency operations during disasters. The platform) Tj T* 0 Tw .377359 Tw (enables autonomous specialized agents \(Medical, Rescue and Logistics Agents\) to navigate disaster zones, locate and rescue trapped victims, provide medical care, and deliver emergency supplies. By integrating) Tj T* 0 Tw (Stable-Baselines3 \(PPO\), PettingZoo ParallelEnv and Streamlit, the system accelerates decision-making, optimizes resource allocation and enhances coordination in complex, dynamic disaster scenarios.) Tj T* ET
